# Bindings generated by the Wails CLI.
#
# The static frontend of the spike loads the runtime from /wails/ipc.js and
# /wails/runtime.js, so it never imports the generated wrappers. The
# directory is kept outside ui/assets on purpose: everything under assets is
# embedded in the binary with go:embed, and a generated file would inflate
# the measured artifact.
/wailsjs/
